{"asset_key":"ep1/env_story_11202350","episode":"ep1","category":"env_story","story_id":"11202350","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1120235001:0":{"text":"휴! 역시 우리 우르 부족이 좋아… 그렇지? 수호자 소렌!","source_cn":"呼！还是我们乌尔氏族好啊……对吧，守护者索恩！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x62D625BC557E8973","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1120235002:0":{"text":"응… 집에 돌아오니까 좋네.","source_cn":"嗯……回家，很好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7818BC51A547D68F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1120235003:0":{"text":"너도 푹 쉬어. 이제 우리 부족도 꽤 강해졌으니까, 가끔 게으름 피워도 될 거야!","source_cn":"好好休息一下吧，现在孩子们都很厉害了，偶尔偷偷懒也可以的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x38282593309B9D76","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:阿尔萨":{"text":"아르사","source":"阿尔萨","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:索恩":{"text":"소렌","source":"索恩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":2}}